{"id":"shineborder","code":"<style>@property --sb{syntax:'<angle>';inherits:false;initial-value:0deg}\n.sbcard{position:relative;width:210px;height:118px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--card,#171B22);\n display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ink,#fff);font:700 15px Inter,sans-serif}\n.sbcard::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:16px;padding:2px;\n background:conic-gradient(from var(--sb),var(--accent,#3366FF),#7A5CFF,#FFD36A,var(--accent,#3366FF));\n -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;\n animation:sbspin 4s linear infinite}\n@keyframes sbspin{to{--sb:360deg}}</style>\n<div class=\"sbcard\">Shine Border</div>"}